WHAT IS OPEN, AND WHERE
───────────────────────
Several packages this estate publishes are deliberately permissive, so anyone
can embed them without asking: the AAO spec, @flashylabs/ledger,
@flashylabs/identity and @flashyid/sdk are Apache-2.0. If you are here for a
format or a verifier rather than for this property, those are what you want,
and they carry no obligation to us.

The estate's licences are declared in one place — `tools/estate-licences.mjs`
in the flashyos repository — so that no repository has to hold its own opinion
about what it is.
